STILL RECORDING, tape 7: "Foto 1 Hour" (2026). Halloway Archive. Original story, pictures, sound and music. A work of fiction.

Pictures: drawn in code (canvas 2D) with the tape kit (channel/brand/tapekit.js): a 2.5D renderer, CCTV grading, the handheld camcorder look, VHS damage and the figure drawing. The prints, the flash and the shadows are drawn for this tape (film.js).
Fonts: VT323 (The VT323 Project Authors), SIL Open Font License 1.1. Special Elite (Astigmatic), Apache License 2.0.
Voice: ElevenLabs text-to-speech, model eleven_v4. Leon Marsh: "HA Leon Marsh" (ElevenLabs Voice Design, made for this series).
Sound effects: generated with ElevenLabs Sound Effects (prompts in sfx/prompts.json).
Music: original score (tools/score.py) played with CC0 samples from VSCO 2 Community Edition.
